                "text": "It\u2019s important that rural hospitals have the support needed to provide patients with life-sustaining care. \n\nI reintroduced the ARCH Act to extend the Medicare-Dependent Hospital program & Medicare low-volume hospital payments to rural hospitals to ensure they can remain open. https://t.co/VsLyz6TAbg",
