                "text": "It\u2019s vital that rural patients & all Americans have access to emergency services.\n\nI joined my colleagues in introducing the Protecting Access to Ground Ambulance Medical Services Act. This provides appropriate reimbursement for emergency service providers so they can continue life-saving care. https://t.co/aGGGEfSER0",
