                "text": "It\u2019s vital that seniors & critically ill patients can easily access their life-saving medication without facing any restrictions.\n\nI joined my colleagues in reintroducing the Seniors\u2019 Access to Critical Medications Act to ensure that Medicare patients can receive their prescriptions through mail or by family or caregiver pickup. https://t.co/e5Qim22LPD",
