                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recently, I met with staff and physicians at Fresenius Medical Care in Lewisburg to see the incredible care they provide to their dialysis patients. \n\nHere in West Virginia, nearly 4,000 individuals are experiencing kidney failure and rely on frequent dialysis treatment. As Co-Chair of the Congressional Kidney Caucus, I am so thankful for their staff\u2019s dedication and look forward to continuing to work with them to ensure the best possible care for patients in need.",
